  "_consent": "Each tool names the customer consent it relies on: a digital-banking consent scope, 'marketing' (the separate personalised-offers consent) or 'none' (public information, or a right that is never gated: complaints, callbacks, declining an offer). The gate refuses the tool without that active consent and records the consent id on the audit record.",
  "_model_view": "model_view: the result fields a model may read. Anything not listed never reaches a model; 'amounts' become placeholders the server fills in the reply; 'public' marks results that carry no customer data. See backend/llm_boundary.py."
